    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d466">

                <pb facs="0769" n="673" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg673"/>

                <head>No. 467.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish to Mr. Brown.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-03-21"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 21,
                        1872</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 9.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Your dispatch No. 50, of the 16th ultimo,
                    has been received. Your course in behalf of the American College of Medicine at
                    Beirut is approved. The privileges conferred upon that college are doubtless
                    favorable, and apparently all that could be obtained.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">HAMILTON FISH.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
